# data and outputs: only what the runs need: the Qwen 9B MATH run (the question files, the groups and
# routes made by run_describe_math.sh, and the seeds and dev split written by its step 3 here,
# since both use the API) and the Qwen 4B runs (qwen4b_experiments.md: SuperGPQA questions, groups,
# routes and seeds; HLE groups, routes and seeds; GPQA-Diamond routes). This repo is public, and HLE
# and GPQA ask that their questions stay out of training data: no file with their question text,
# answers or graded replies is pushed. Those travel in qwen4b_hle_gpqa_data.tar.gz, sent separately.
datasets/*
!datasets/math_l5_300_train.json
!datasets/math_l5_test.json
!datasets/supergpqa_600_train.json
!datasets/supergpqa_2k_test.json
*.tar.gz
